  "description": "A man named Kiuido appeared. In front of Baek Chan-young, 20 years old, lonely is everyday life and bored is everyday. “I don’t have any money.” “Really? what should I do.” Dark eyes, light brown hair, and tattoos that can be seen under the sleeves of a shirt. A man who thought he must be a gangster, but who was only the director of a high-starred neighborhood home medicine hospital. Ki Uido came to Chanyoung for one reason. I don't want to be a gangster boss, so please help me find the father of the original boss, Chanyoung. I want to find my mother who disappeared with me.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5467000060), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12073882), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/conscience), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250026), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67698213)",
